{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>By the mouth of YHWH.</b> Moses said before the Holy One, blessed be He: How do I enter into their tents to know the number of their infants? The Holy One, blessed be He, said to him: You do your part and I shall do Mine. Moses went and stood at the entrance of the tent, and the Shechinah preceded him, and a bat kol went out from the tent and said: So-and-so many infants are in this tent. Therefore it says עַל פִּי ה׳."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:14.128276783Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}